> Inspect the fitted samples and objective

Columns show left vertical, left horizontal, right vertical and right
horizontal. The template check compares each sample with the twelve clean
bar patterns, allowing either orientation to shift vertically.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/text_image_diffusion_samples.png", flags="-std=c++23"}
#include <filesystem>

int main() {
  std::filesystem::create_directories("figures");
  std::filesystem::copy_file("build/text_image_diffusion/samples.png",
                             "figures/text_image_diffusion_samples.png",
                             std::filesystem::copy_options::overwrite_existing);
}
